  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nimport sys\r\ninput=sys.stdin.readline\r\n\r\nt=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    \r\n    pref=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        pref[i+1]=pref[i]+a[i]\r\n    ans=0\r\n    for A in range(n+1):\r\n        low=0\r\n        high=n-A\r\n        while low<high:\r\n            B=(low+high)//2\r\n            k=A+2*B\r\n            last=3*n-2*A-B\r\n            change=a[k] + a[k+1] -3 * a[last-1]\r\n            if change>=0:\r\n                low=B+1\r\n            else:\r\n                high=B\r\n        for B in (low-1, low):\r\n            if 0<=B<=n-A:\r\n                C=n-A-B\r\n                pos1=A\r\n                pos2=A+2*B\r\n                pos3=A+2*B+3*C\r\n                total=(6*pref[pos1] + 4*(pref[pos2] - pref[pos1]) + 3*(pref[pos3] - pref[pos2]))\r\n                ans=max(ans,total)\r\n    print(ans)",
